      "role": "user",
      "content": "that seems like a pretty extreme take though. most urban planners and cops i talk to say that with proper audits and transparency, you can absolutely balance safety and privacy. why do you think the risks are so much more \"certain\" than the actual, real-world benefits of catching criminals and making commuting easier for millions of people?",
